acksteel Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Icy_Blacksteel_Sword_23247d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Icy Blacksteel Sword</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Blacksteel Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Earth_Blacksteel_Sword_56dac3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Earth Blacksteel Sword</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Energy Blacksteel Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Blacksteel_Sword_a6f36d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Energy Blacksteel Sword</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Fiery Blacksteel Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fiery_Blacksteel_Sword_575972.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Fiery Blacksteel Sword</li></ul>\n<p>These sprites are now used for their respective replicas.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sellto\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr